% Split the current goal into two branches by assuming either Cond or not Cond.

w3_run Rest Goal [focused-task Rest Goal].

w3_case Cond Rest (goal-formula GoalPr Goal)
    [ focused-task Rest (local-prop "h" Cond (goal-formula GoalPr Goal))
    , focused-task Rest (local-prop "h" (tnot Cond) (goal-formula GoalPr Goal))
    ].

w3_case _ Rest Goal [focused-task Rest Goal].